{"id":"014d273e1638c39c","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Ill Founded Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree — ZFC Tree8 Ill Founded Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree — ZFC Tree8 Ill Founded Tree","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-ill-founded-tree — ZFC Tree8 Ill Founded Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\preccurlyeq_T\\in V\">\\(T,\\preccurlyeq_T\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> is the registered set-coded function predicate</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the tree-order predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}ill\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\land\\exists b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(b,\\omega,T)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b(n)\\neq b(n+1)\\land\\langle b(n),b(n+1)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}ill\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\land\\exists b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(b,\\omega,T)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b(n)\\neq b(n+1)\\land\\langle b(n),b(n+1)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ill-foundedness is witnessed by a three-place typed infinite chain in the reflexive tree order; the inequality extracts its strict part.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the tree-order predicate (see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"T,\\preccurlyeq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}ill\\text{-}founded\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8IllFoundedTree}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\land\\exists b\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(b,\\omega,T)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(b(n)\\neq b(n+1)\\land\\langle b(n),b(n+1)\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1404,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3812","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-